---
import { SITE } from "../config";
---

<section id="crea-tu-sistema-bow" class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24 scroll-mt-16">
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[#4928C2]/50 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0B0D12] via-[#040607] to-[#5B2A62]/25 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(4,6,7,0.9)]">
    <!-- Ambient Light Accent -->
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-[#BF40FA]/10 blur-3xl"></div>

    <div class="grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <!-- Left: Inbound Preview Form -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#4928C2]/50 bg-[#4928C2]/15 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-[#E3D9FC] uppercase">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
          <span>SOLICITUD INBOUND · ENTREGA EN &lt; 24 HORAS</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-outfit text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#F8F6FF] sm:text-4xl">
          CREÁ TU SISTEMA BOW: <span class="text-[#BF40FA]">Pedí tu preview gratuita en vivo</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#E3D9FC]/85">
          Completá los datos de tu consultorio o estudio. Nuestro sistema registra tu ficha en Supabase, te notifica por email y te armamos una propuesta interactiva en vivo con 4 paletas de color en menos de 24 horas, sin costo ni compromiso.
        </p>

        <!-- Formulario Inbound 0-JS -->
        <form
          action="/api/v1/bow-system/create"
          method="POST"
          class="mt-8 space-y-4 rounded-2xl border border-[#4928C2]/35 bg-[#040607]/80 p-6 shadow-inner"
        >
          <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div>
              <label for="lead-nombre" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC]/90 mb-1.5">
                Nombre y Apellido *
              </label>
              <input
                type="text"
                id="lead-nombre"
                name="name"
                required
                placeholder="Ej: Dra. Sofía Martínez"
                class="w-full rounded-xl border border-[#4928C2]/40 bg-[#0B0D12] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs text-[#F8F6FF] placeholder-[#E3D9FC]/60 outline-none transition-all focus:border-[#BF40FA] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#BF40FA]"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label for="lead-rubro" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC]/90 mb-1.5">
                Especialidad o Rubro *
              </label>
              <select
                id="lead-rubro"
                name="rubro"
                required
                class="w-full rounded-xl border border-[#4928C2]/40 bg-[#0B0D12] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs text-[#F8F6FF] outline-none transition-all focus:border-[#BF40FA] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#BF40FA]"
              >
                <option value="Medicina Estética & Dermatología">Medicina Estética &amp; Dermatología</option>
                <option value="Odontología & Estética Dental">Odontología &amp; Estética Dental</option>
                <option value="Cirugía Plástica & Reparadora">Cirugía Plástica &amp; Reparadora</option>
                <option value="Nutrición Funcional & Deportiva">Nutrición Funcional &amp; Deportiva</option>
                <option value="Estudio Jurídico & Abogacía">Estudio Jurídico &amp; Abogacía</option>
                <option value="Kinesiología & Alto Rendimiento">Kinesiología &amp; Alto Rendimiento</option>
                <option value="Clínica / Centro Médico">Clínica / Centro Médico</option>
                <option value="Otro Servicio Profesional">Otro Servicio Profesional</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="lead-maps" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC]/90 mb-1.5">
              Link de Google Maps, Instagram o Web actual
            </label>
            <input
              type="text"
              id="lead-maps"
              name="maps_url"
              placeholder="https://maps.app.goo.gl/... o @tu_consultorio"
              class="w-full rounded-xl border border-[#4928C2]/40 bg-[#0B0D12] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs text-[#F8F6FF] placeholder-[#E3D9FC]/60 outline-none transition-all focus:border-[#BF40FA] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#BF40FA]"
            />
          </div>

          <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div>
              <label for="lead-whatsapp" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC]/90 mb-1.5">
                WhatsApp de Contacto *
              </label>
              <input
                type="tel"
                id="lead-whatsapp"
                name="whatsapp"
                required
                placeholder="+54 9 11 1234-5678"
                class="w-full rounded-xl border border-[#4928C2]/40 bg-[#0B0D12] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs text-[#F8F6FF] placeholder-[#E3D9FC]/60 outline-none transition-all focus:border-[#BF40FA] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#BF40FA]"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label for="lead-email" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-[#E3D9FC]/90 mb-1.5">
                Email para recibir la demo *
              </label>
              <input
                type="email"
                id="lead-email"
                name="email"
                required
                placeholder="doctora@tudominio.com"
                class="w-full rounded-xl border border-[#4928C2]/40 bg-[#0B0D12] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs text-[#F8F6FF] placeholder-[#E3D9FC]/60 outline-none transition-all focus:border-[#BF40FA] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#BF40FA]"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2">
            <button
              type="submit"
              class="flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-[#BF40FA] to-[#4928C2] px-6 py-3.5 text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#F8F6FF] transition-all duration-300 hover:brightness-110 shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(191,64,250,0.35)] cursor-pointer"
            >
              <span>⚡ Solicitar Mi Preview Gratuita (Demora &lt; 24hs)</span>
              <span>→</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </form>

        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-[#E3D9FC]/70">
          <span>🔒 Cero spam · Cumplimiento Ley 25.326</span>
          <a
            href={SITE.whatsappUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="font-semibold text-emerald-400 hover:underline"
          >
            ¿Querés pedirla por WhatsApp directo? +54 9 3489 53-6088 →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Real-time API & Supabase Architecture Console -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#4928C2]/45 bg-[#040607] p-5 font-mono text-xs text-[#E3D9FC] shadow-inner">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#4928C2]/25 pb-3 mb-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/70"></span>
              <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400/70"></span>
              <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400/70"></span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-[#BF40FA] font-bold">POST /api/v1/bow-system/create</span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            <p class="text-[#E3D9FC]/60">// Flujo Inbound Automatizado NexoBow</p>
            <p><span class="text-[#BF40FA]">"lead_source"</span>: <span class="text-emerald-300">"inbound_web"</span>,</p>
            <p><span class="text-[#BF40FA]">"database"</span>: <span class="text-emerald-300">"Supabase PostgreSQL (ACID)"</span>,</p>
            <p><span class="text-[#BF40FA]">"notification"</span>: <span class="text-emerald-300">"Juanma Merodio (+54 9 3489 53-6088)"</span>,</p>
            <p><span class="text-[#BF40FA]">"compiler"</span>: <span class="text-emerald-300">"Astro SSG Engine &lt;0.8s"</span>,</p>
            <p><span class="text-[#BF40FA]">"theme_switcher"</span>: <span class="text-emerald-300">"4 paletas interactivas"</span>,</p>
            <p><span class="text-[#BF40FA]">"delivery_channel"</span>: <span class="text-emerald-300">"WhatsApp + Email"</span></p>
            
            <div class="my-3 border-t border-[#4928C2]/20 pt-2.5 space-y-1">
              <p class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓ Lead registrado en tabla CRM</p>
              <p class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓ Alerta en tiempo real disparada</p>
              <p class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓ Preview lista en preview.nexobow.site</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Phone & Direct Contact Badge -->
        <div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-950/20 p-4 text-xs text-[#E3D9FC]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-emerald-300 mb-1">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
            <span>Atención Personalizada del Fundador</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-[#E3D9FC]/80">
            Cada solicitud es revisada personalmente por <strong>Juanma Merodio</strong> al WhatsApp <strong>+54 9 3489 53-6088</strong> para asegurar que tu diseño refleje la categoría de tu consultorio.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
